18
00:00:40,753 --> 00:00:42,662
And what's that now?

19
00:00:44,312 --> 00:00:47,349
An out-of-band swap is a technique you can

20
00:00:47,413 --> 00:00:49,125
apply with HTMX

21
00:00:49,658 --> 00:00:54,260
that allows you to return multiple HTML

22
00:00:54,324 --> 00:00:57,983
