51
00:02:26,202 --> 00:02:28,400
perform such an out-of-band swap.

52
00:02:29,193 --> 00:02:30,939
And in my case here, I wanna return an

53
00:02:31,197 --> 00:02:32,119
unordered list.

54
00:02:34,521 --> 00:02:37,691
To be precise, I wanna return this available

55
00:02:37,885 --> 00:02:39,422
locations unordered list.

56
00:02:41,226 --> 00:02:43,498
And therefore indeed we can copy that. And

57
00:02:43,514 --> 00:02:45,900
it's important that you copy the available

58
00:02:45,900 --> 00:02:46,485
locations list, not the interesting

59
00:02:46,485 --> 00:02:46,745
locations list.

60
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:52,010
Because it's the available locations list I

61
00:02:52,074 --> 00:02:56,137
wanna update here. I'll copy that and return

62
00:02:56,266 --> 00:02:59,235
that here as that second piece of content in

63
00:02:59,235 --> 00:03:01,114
my response in this POST route.

64
00:03:02,636 --> 00:03:03,413
Now, right now,

65
00:03:03,948 --> 00:03:05,777
this would still all be treated as

66
00:03:06,441 --> 00:03:06,668
one

67
00:03:07,251 --> 00:03:10,291
response, so to say, one piece of content,

68
00:03:10,534 --> 00:03:12,122
and it would be this entire piece of

69
00:03:12,154 --> 00:03:15,522
content, so this list item, and this list

70
00:03:16,195 --> 00:03:19,448
that would be swapped in for this targeted

71
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:22,253
location. So for this interesting locations

72
00:03:22,285 --> 00:03:22,621
list.

73
00:03:23,711 --> 00:03:25,811
And that's of course not what I want here. I

74
00:03:25,971 --> 00:03:29,609
only wanna swap in this first element into

75
00:03:29,657 --> 00:03:31,276
this interesting locations list.

76
00:03:31,805 --> 00:03:35,090
And this second element here, this available

77
00:03:35,267 --> 00:03:38,713
locations list, should instead replace the

78
00:03:38,713 --> 00:03:41,998
existing available locations list that's

79
00:03:42,078 --> 00:03:43,649
already on the screen, on the page.

80
00:03:45,455 --> 00:03:47,514
And we can achieve this by adding a special

81
00:03:47,691 --> 00:03:50,907
attribute to this unordered list in this

82
00:03:50,907 --> 00:03:51,599
