114
00:05:26,248 --> 00:05:27,095
So for example,

115
00:05:27,616 --> 00:05:29,717
the first unordered list that is found.

116
00:05:31,465 --> 00:05:33,205
But I don't need that here. Instead, here

117
00:05:33,205 --> 00:05:35,331
I'll just set this to true, which means I

118
00:05:35,411 --> 00:05:37,730
