119
00:05:37,811 --> 00:05:40,404
HTMX will look for an element with this ID

120
00:05:40,629 --> 00:05:42,625
and will then entirely replace it.

121
00:05:43,527 --> 00:05:46,376
And that allows me to now return 2

122
00:05:46,988 --> 00:05:49,789
elements in this response content that will

123
00:05:49,886 --> 00:05:52,631
